    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "n_user",
        "dfdRoleLegacy": false,
        "title": "Knowledge Worker",
        "description": "Synthetic reference design, not an observed deployment or security/compliance certification. External signed-in worker queries documents they are authorized to read. No device persistence or token issuance is modeled; the worker remains visible in both scenarios.\n\nPrivacy/retention: Questions/answers and identity context are processing-only; the index retains chunks/ACLs for active documents and purges within 24 hours of source deletion. Aggregate metrics expire after an illustrative 30 days. Provider processing-only is a contract assumption requiring review of actual provider retention, not a claim about every Azure OpenAI configuration.",
        "type": "ExternalUser",
        "serviceTreeId": "",
        "endpointRegex": "",
        "position": {
          "x": 40,
          "y": 300
        },
        "size": {
          "width": 142,
          "height": 78
        },
        "color": "#fed7aa"
      },
      {
        "id": "n_app",
        "dfdRoleLegacy": false,
        "title": "Assistant Web App",
        "description": "Synthetic reference design, not an observed deployment or security/compliance certification. In-scope frontend: validates session, forwards delegated assistant.query, renders generated text as inert content and stores neither prompt nor answer locally. Not an excluded supporting infrastructure component.\n\nPrivacy/retention: Questions/answers and identity context are processing-only; the index retains chunks/ACLs for active documents and purges within 24 hours of source deletion. Aggregate metrics expire after an illustrative 30 days. Provider processing-only is a contract assumption requiring review of actual provider retention, not a claim about every Azure OpenAI configuration.",
        "type": "azure.compute.app-service-app",
        "serviceTreeId": "",
        "endpointRegex": "^https://app\\.aidocumentassistant\\.example(?:/|$)",
        "position": {
          "x": 360,
          "y": 300
        },
        "size": {
          "width": 137,
          "height": 74
        },
        "color": "#bfdbfe"
      },
      {
        "id": "n_gateway",
        "dfdRoleLegacy": false,
        "title": "Retrieval Gateway",
        "description": "Synthetic reference design, not an observed deployment or security/compliance certification. In-scope orchestration service owns tenant/user authorization. Derives ACL filters from validated claims, requests minimum chunks, treats retrieved text as untrusted content and cannot invoke tools. Emits only aggregate counters through a separate allowlisted telemetry path.\n\nPrivacy/retention: Questions/answers and identity context are processing-only; the index retains chunks/ACLs for active documents and purges within 24 hours of source deletion. Aggregate metrics expire after an illustrative 30 days. Provider processing-only is a contract assumption requiring review of actual provider retention, not a claim about every Azure OpenAI configuration.",
        "type": "azure.compute.app-service-app",
        "serviceTreeId": "",
        "endpointRegex": "^https://gateway\\.aidocumentassistant\\.example(?:/|$)",
        "position": {
          "x": 730,
          "y": 300
        },
        "size": {
          "width": 133,
          "height": 74
        },
        "color": "#bfdbfe"
      },
      {
        "id": "n_model",
        "dfdRoleOverride": "ExternalInteractor",
        "dfdRoleLegacy": false,
        "title": "Azure OpenAI Provider",
        "description": "Synthetic reference design, not an observed deployment or security/compliance certification. Separately operated Azure OpenAI inference endpoint. This instance is explicitly an External Interactor, not a subject process. Approved geography, retention/abuse-monitoring handling and no training on prompts require a provider-specific review; processing-only is a reference contract assumption, not a universal product default.\n\nPrivacy/retention: Questions/answers and identity context are processing-only; the index retains chunks/ACLs for active documents and purges within 24 hours of source deletion. Aggregate metrics expire after an illustrative 30 days. Provider processing-only is a contract assumption requiring review of actual provider retention, not a claim about every Azure OpenAI configuration.",
        "type": "azure.ai.openai",
        "serviceTreeId": "",
        "endpointRegex": "^https://model\\.aidocumentassistant\\.example(?:/|$)",
        "position": {
          "x": 1090,
          "y": 100
        },
        "size": {
          "width": 158,
          "height": 78
        },
        "color": "#fed7aa"
      },
      {
        "id": "n_vector",
        "dfdRoleOverride": "DataStore",
        "dfdRoleLegacy": false,
        "title": "Azure AI Search Index",
        "description": "Synthetic reference design, not an observed deployment or security/compliance certification. Application-owned persistent search index, explicitly a Data Store. Gateway MI has query-only access, not index management. Tenant/document ACL security trimming is enforced by Gateway and validated on returned chunks; index ingestion must preserve trustworthy ACL metadata. Stored documents/ACLs are purged with source deletion within 24 hours.\n\nPrivacy/retention: Questions/answers and identity context are processing-only; the index retains chunks/ACLs for active documents and purges within 24 hours of source deletion. Aggregate metrics expire after an illustrative 30 days. Provider processing-only is a contract assumption requiring review of actual provider retention, not a claim about every Azure OpenAI configuration.",
        "type": "azure.ai.search",
        "serviceTreeId": "",
        "endpointRegex": "",
        "position": {
          "x": 1090,
          "y": 300
        },
        "size": {
          "width": 149,
          "height": 78
        },
        "color": "#bbf7d0"
      },
      {
        "id": "n_logs",
        "dfdRoleOverride": "DataStore",
        "dfdRoleLegacy": false,
        "title": "Metrics Workspace",
        "description": "Synthetic reference design, not an observed deployment or security/compliance certification. In-scope application-owned Log Analytics workspace. Only allowlisted aggregate count/latency metrics are retained, for an illustrative 30 days. Reject prompt, excerpt, subject, tenant and correlation identifiers. No raw payload logging; workspace access and retention configuration require deployment evidence.\n\nPrivacy/retention: Questions/answers and identity context are processing-only; the index retains chunks/ACLs for active documents and purges within 24 hours of source deletion. Aggregate metrics expire after an illustrative 30 days. Provider processing-only is a contract assumption requiring review of actual provider retention, not a claim about every Azure OpenAI configuration.",
        "type": "azure.ops.log-analytics",
        "serviceTreeId": "",
        "endpointRegex": "^https://logs\\.aidocumentassistant\\.example(?:/|$)",
        "position": {
          "x": 1090,
          "y": 565
        },
        "size": {
          "width": 157,
          "height": 78
        },
        "color": "#bbf7d0"
      }
