      {
        "id": "s_secure",
        "name": "01 | Reference - authorized grounding",
        "description": "Synthetic reference design, not an observed deployment or security/compliance certification. Questions/answers and identity context are processing-only; the index retains chunks/ACLs for active documents and purges within 24 hours of source deletion. Aggregate metrics expire after an illustrative 30 days. Provider processing-only is a contract assumption requiring review of actual provider retention, not a claim about every Azure OpenAI configuration. All subject processes and stores are in scope; external participants are visible black boxes, not excluded infrastructure. Numbering orders requests; response buckets return on the same call, not a second login.",
